[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Edgemodders/EDGEkit/main/docs/assets/brand/banner.png[/img][/center]

[center][size=5][b][color=#fcee0a]One editor for Cyberpunk 2077 modding. Every EDGE tool built in. AI included.[/color][/b][/size][/center]

[center][size=3]Install one app and get a modding IDE that already knows Night City: WolvenKit projects, the game's archives, the TweakDB, redscript, a mod manager, a HUD theme made for the game, and an AI assistant that can read your mod, run it in the game and help you fix it.[/size][/center]

[line]

[quote][size=4][b][color=#fcee0a]STATUS: IN DEVELOPMENT[/color][/b][/size]
EDGEkit is being built in the open. The plan is decided and the first build of the editor is under way (phase K1). There is no installer yet: the first one comes with phase K4 (see the roadmap below).
[b]You can use the tools today.[/b] The [b]EDGEkit extension pack[/b] installs REDcode, EDGEdeck, the REDnode HUD theme and REDscript IDE in VS Code or VSCodium in one go: get it from the [url=https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=edgemodders.edgekit]VS Code Marketplace[/url] or [url=https://open-vsx.org/extension/edgemodders/edgekit]Open VSX[/url]. It is a preview, and REDcode and EDGEdeck need Windows x64.
[b]Track this page[/b] to hear when the EDGEkit installer lands.[/quote]

[line]

[size=5][b][color=#fcee0a]What EDGEkit is[/color][/b][/size]

EDGEkit is a single unified modding ecosystem built by [url=https://edgemodders.ai/]EDGEmodders[/url], a new modding community whose idea is simple: [b]anyone can mod[/b]. AI assistants make modding possible for people who have never written a line of code, and EDGEkit puts everything they need in one place.

Under the hood it is a build of [b]Code - OSS[/b], the open-source core that VS Code is made from, with EDGEmodders branding and the EDGE extensions built in. If you have used VS Code, you already know how to use EDGEkit. If you have not, you do not need to: it opens on what a Cyberpunk modder needs.

EDGEkit is also in the VS Code marketplace as an extension bundle so you can just add it to your existing VS Code work environment.
[list]
[*][url=https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=edgemodders.edgekit]VS Code Marketplace[/url][/*]
[*][url=https://open-vsx.org/extension/edgemodders/edgekit]Open VSX[/url][/*]
[/list]

[color=#00ffff]A short list of what EDGEkit provides:[/color]

[list]
[*]Full TweakDB explorer with hyperlinked records[/*]
[*]Find, browse, play and edit game audio (EDGEwave)[/*]
[*]Feature complete Mod Manager with loadouts (EDGEdeck)[/*]
[*]Wolvenkit Compatible Mod Builder (REDcode)[/*]
[*]Browse all Game Assets in friendly tree with search and filter[/*]
[*]A Claude Code modding assistant that can make your mod for you[/*]
[*]A ton more[/*]
[/list]
